00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:04,120
I think you'll hack it just fine.

282
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:07,740
Compared to the gore fest we've watched on our past movie nights, this should be a cakewalk.

283
00:18:08,340 --> 00:18:09,260
You're a professional.

284
00:18:09,260 --> 00:18:10,800
Strike one.

285
00:18:13,320 --> 00:18:15,860
Pretend to be afraid so he can comfort you.

286
00:18:17,080 --> 00:18:18,220
So scary!

287
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,400
You scared the pants off me.

288
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:23,160
There goes strike two.

289
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,940
Maybe this tactic's a lost cause.

290
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:28,580
You could always give hand-holding during the movie a try.

291
00:18:30,020 --> 00:18:32,720
I-I sure am petrified.

292
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:41,580
All I want to do is enjoy a movie with him.

293
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,560
I'm sorry I'm such a wimp.

294
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:44,780
I really am.

295
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:46,800
It's nothing you have to apologize for!

296
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:49,240
Getting a little jumpy isn't a big deal!

297
00:18:49,620 --> 00:18:49,880
I know.

298
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,480
Just give me a second.

299
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:52,640
I need a moment.

300
00:18:54,100 --> 00:18:54,540
No.

301
00:18:55,440 --> 00:18:56,740
He's gonna dump me, isn't he?

302
00:18:57,740 --> 00:18:58,700
Strike three!

303
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:01,260
I'm pitiful.

304
00:19:01,260 --> 00:19:03,700
What is she doing?

305
00:19:08,060 --> 00:19:08,780
You okay?

306
00:19:12,120 --> 00:19:14,360
I'm not okay, and I'm not cute.

307
00:19:15,340 --> 00:19:16,840
Hey now, you're cute.

308
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:17,920
You're very cute.

309
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:19,460
I don't get scared.

310
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:21,200
I can't even act scared.

311
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:24,180
I'm just a hopeless, uncute excuse for a human.

312
00:19:24,760 --> 00:19:29,140
So all that stuff you pulled in the living room was you trying to act more cute for me?

313
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:30,640
Not like it matters, dummy.

314
00:19:31,240 --> 00:19:32,540
If it was, I'm sorry.

315
00:19:32,860 --> 00:19:35,180
I-I was too busy freaking out to even see.

316
00:19:35,420 --> 00:19:36,440
Sorry I didn't notice you.

317
00:19:36,440 --> 00:19:38,880
Why is it that you keep apologizing to me?

318
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,420
Don't look, you big dummy!

319
00:19:41,420 --> 00:19:43,280
I think you're the big dummy this time.

320
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:46,640
I didn't fall for just some cute girl, you know.

321
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:48,140
I fell in love with you.

322
00:19:49,620 --> 00:19:50,700
Let's finish the movie.

323
00:19:51,420 --> 00:19:52,380
That sound like a plan?

324
00:19:52,380 --> 00:19:57,100
Oh, wow.

325
00:19:57,300 --> 00:19:58,540
That's really coming down.

326
00:19:58,920 --> 00:19:59,760
Yeah, sure is.

327
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:02,980
I'm the same.

328
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:05,820
I fell for him just as hard.

329
00:20:06,820 --> 00:20:08,360
I fell for his long eyelashes

330
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:10,820
and the way he scares so easily.

331
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:13,300
I fell for his sarcastic quips

332
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:15,820
and how his slender frame feels in my arms.

333
00:20:16,600 --> 00:20:17,240
His voice.

334
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:19,820
I-I fell for...

335
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:21,020
Izumi.

336
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:36,480
What's wrong?

337
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:38,060
Nothing.

338
00:20:38,560 --> 00:20:39,700
I'm listening to your heart.

339
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:47,580
And you can understand what it's telling you?

340
00:20:49,020 --> 00:20:50,580
It's saying how cold it is.

341
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:56,580
You're freezing.

342
00:20:57,340 --> 00:20:59,180
Your hands and ears are like ice.

343
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,840
Probably from the rain.

344
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:02,540
Probably.

345
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:05,300
There's no way you're going home,

346
00:21:05,600 --> 00:21:06,580
not in this downpour.

347
00:21:06,580 --> 00:21:10,560
There was a fire within me.

348
00:21:11,220 --> 00:21:13,000
And I wanted Miyamura to feel it too.

349
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:20,980
It's you, me, and Sissy having fun!

350
00:21:24,780 --> 00:21:25,560
What's wrong?

351
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:28,340
You know, she's my big sister.

352
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:32,560
Wait a minute.

353
00:21:33,240 --> 00:21:35,240
Sota, are you worried that I'm taking her away?

354
00:21:36,580 --> 00:21:38,240
I won't.

355
00:21:38,880 --> 00:21:40,380
She'll always be your big sis.

356
00:21:41,380 --> 00:21:42,640
And what about you?

357
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,340
What else?

358
00:21:44,340 --> 00:21:45,780
I'll always be your big bro.

359
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,640
I promise I won't take your sister from you.

360
00:21:49,840 --> 00:21:51,460
But could I maybe have Kyoko?

361
00:21:53,300 --> 00:21:53,740
Okay.

362
00:21:53,740 --> 00:21:54,440
Okay.

363
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:54,880
Yeah.

364
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,840
You're not me.

365
00:21:57,560 --> 00:21:58,000
Okay.

366
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:02,460
Later, I was seen through my dreams

367
00:22:02,460 --> 00:22:06,320
And the bright night is to consider

368
00:22:06,320 --> 00:22:11,380
It's back to you

369
00:22:11,380 --> 00:22:13,900
Mr. slight rolling

370
00:22:13,900 --> 00:22:19,100
This gives you being a bright bright night

371
00:22:19,100 --> 00:22:21,860
You'll also write you back

372
00:22:21,860 --> 00:22:23,920
This is my ghost

373
00:22:23,920 --> 00:22:29,920
姿が名残惜しくって

374
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:35,920
長袖のシャツに見覚えある道

375
00:22:35,920 --> 00:22:40,920
少し寂しそうに見えた

376
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:47,920
胸が苦しくなるけど暖かい

377
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:52,920
気付いた冬の朝だ

378
00:22:52,920 --> 00:22:58,920
約束するよ

379
00:22:58,920 --> 00:23:05,920
近くにいるから見えないものほど

380
00:23:05,920 --> 00:23:10,920
大事にするよ

381
